================================================================================
Third-party projects
================================================================================

StickerBook is built on, and tested against, the projects below. Their source
is NOT vendored in this repository: the upstream trees are cloned locally and
excluded via .gitignore, and the exact commits tested or pinned are recorded in
jev/VERSIONS.txt and openshell/PIN.env. The attributions here are given because the work depends on
them, and so that anyone building the experiment images knows what they are
assembling and under which terms.

